{{Basis}}

From {{abbr|1100|914 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} until {{abbr|1564|1299 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, the [[Duchy of Qym]] and its successor, the [[Principality of Qym]], was ruled by the [[House of Neliko]]. Since {{abbr|1564|1299 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, the principality and its successor, the [[Qym|Kingdom of Qym]], has been ruled by the [[House of Zhifol]]. 

